Cyclotomic -- cyclotomic fields
*******************************

Description
===========

Cyclotomic is a package for cyclotomic fields.  It is used in to construct
extensions of the coefficient field during binomial primary decomposition using
the package *note Binomials: (Binomials)Top,.

Author
======

  * Thomas Kahle (see http://thomas-kahle.de ) <thomas.kahle@jpberlin.de>

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 1.0 of Cyclotomic, released February 2012.

