cyclotomicPoly -- Cyclotomic Polynomial
***************************************

  * Usage: 
        cyclotomicPoly (i,v)
  * Inputs:
      * i, an integer, the power of a root of unity.
      * v, a variable name in which the polynomial is returned.
  * Outputs:
      * f, The minimal polynomial of the i-th root of unity.

Description
===========

+------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[ww]               |
|                              |
|o1 = R                        |
|                              |
|o1 : PolynomialRing           |
+------------------------------+
|i2 : f = cyclotomicPoly (6,ww)|
|                              |
|       2                      |
|o2 = ww  - ww + 1             |
|                              |
|o2 : R                        |
+------------------------------+

