findRootPower -- Find the order of the root in the coefficients of polynomial ring over a cyclotomic field
**********************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        findRootPower R
  * Inputs:
      * R, a polynomial ring over a cyclotomic field
  * Outputs:
      * i, The order of the adjoined root of unity, or 2 if the coefficient
        field is QQ

Description
===========

+--------------------------+
|i1 : S = cyclotomicField 5|
|                          |
|o1 = S                    |
|                          |
|o1 : PolynomialRing       |
+--------------------------+
|i2 : T = S[x,y]           |
|                          |
|o2 = T                    |
|                          |
|o2 : PolynomialRing       |
+--------------------------+
|i3 : findRootPower T      |
|                          |
|o3 = 5                    |
+--------------------------+

