joinCyclotomic -- Join ideals in polynomial rings over different cyclotomic fields
**********************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        joinCyclotomic l
  * Inputs:
      * li, a list of ideals in polynomial rings over cyclotomic fields
  * Outputs:
      * li2, The list of ideals in a common ring.

Description
===========

+--------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : F = cyclotomicField 3; G = cyclotomicField 4;|
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : R = F[t]; I = ideal (t-F_0^2)                |
|                                                  |
|o4 = ideal(t + ww  + 1)                           |
|                 3                                |
|                                                  |
|o4 : Ideal of R                                   |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : S = G[t]; J = ideal (t^2-G_0)                |
|                                                  |
|            2                                     |
|o6 = ideal(t  - ww )                              |
|                  4                               |
|                                                  |
|o6 : Ideal of S                                   |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : joinCyclotomic {I,J}                         |
|                                                  |
|                  2           2     3             |
|o7 = {ideal(t + ww  ), ideal(t  - ww  )}          |
|                  12                12            |
|                                                  |
|o7 : List                                         |
+--------------------------------------------------+

